    "user_verified": true,
    "text": "Everyone’s building AI agents\n\nAlmost no one knows which orchestration framework to use \n\nHere’s how to stop winging it :\n\n⭕️ Use n8n when:\n\n • You’re integrating LLMs with tools\n • Your flow is trigger → AI → action\n • You want fast, no-code deployment\n • You don’t need agent memory\n\n ⭕️ Use LangGraph when:\n\n • Your agents need to think, loop, reflect\n • You want memory + state across steps\n • You’re building logic trees, retries, branching \n  paths\n • You need observability",
